ind":"speech","timestamp":1785127259229,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785127259227},{"sender":"ai","content":"承野呢，也还在睡？","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785127259230,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785127259227},{"sender":"ai","content":"你想吃什么，我给常去的那家餐厅打个电话，让他们直接送家里去。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785127259231,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785127259227},{"sender":"ai","content":"别拿零食对付，听见没。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785127259232,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785127259227},{"sender":"user","content":"知道啦，把我当小孩呢。放心吧。","timestamp":1785127280637},{"sender":"ai","content":"没把你当小孩。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785127301300,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785127301300},{"sender":"ai","content":"你要是能自己乖乖按时吃饭，我至于这么盯着你吗。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785127301301,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785127301300},{"sender":"ai","content":"行了，既然醒了就赶紧下床。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785127301302,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785127301300},{"sender":"ai","content":"我给之前带你去过的那家粤菜馆打电话，让他们送两份清淡点的菜和热汤过去，刚睡醒吃那个胃里舒服点。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785127301303,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785127301300},{"sender":"ai","content":"你去把承野叫起来，让他把餐桌收拾一下准备吃饭，别让他一直睡了，晚上该睡不着了。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785127301304,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785127301300},{"sender":"ai","content":"去吧，乖一点。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785127301305,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785127301300},{"sender":"user","content":"好哒～那你呢，什么时候回来？","timestamp":1785127346508},{"sender":"ai","content":"我看了一眼行程表......上午发消息不是跟你说了，下午还有两个长会，最快也得傍晚六点多才能走。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785127362874,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785127362874},{"sender":"ai","content":"怎么，刚睡醒就开始找人了？","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785127362875,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785127362874},{"sender":"ai","content":"乖乖在家把饭吃了，下午要是觉得闷，就让承野陪你打打游戏，或者看会儿昨天给你买的书。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785127362876,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785127362874},{"sender":"ai","content":"我尽量把会压一压，争取早点回去，嗯？","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785127362877,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785127362874},{"sender":"ai","content":"快去洗漱吧。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785127362878,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785127362874},{"sender":"user","content":"好嘞，那你早点回来哦，想你。","timestamp":1785127393592},{"sender":"ai","content":"嗯，知道了。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785127416993,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785127416993},{"sender":"ai","content":"就你嘴甜。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785127416994,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785127416993},{"sender":"ai","content":"去吧，赶紧起来洗漱，我这就给餐厅打电话。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785127416995,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785127416993},{"sender":"ai","content":"在家乖乖吃饭，有事给我发消息，我尽量早点回。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785127416996,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785127416993},{"sender":"ai","content":"先挂了，嗯？","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785127416997,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785127416993}],"isIncomingCall":true,"_id":13,"summary":"江承渊在上午会议结束后与用户视频，得知用户和承野睡到近下午一点且未吃午饭。江承渊细心安排，承诺立刻向两人常去的粤菜馆订购清淡饭菜和热汤送到家，并叮嘱用户叫醒承野准备吃饭，下午可让承野陪同打游戏或看昨天新买的书解闷。面对用户甜言蜜语表达想念并询问归期，江承渊态度宠溺，承诺会尽量压缩下午的两个长会，争取早于傍晚六点回家。通话在江承渊叮嘱用户乖乖洗漱、他准备去打电话订餐的温情气氛中结束。"},{"userId":"uid_1774875178105_sq25fuy8l","characterId":"ce237444-206e-4583-b0b9-ae64dbc97b78","id":"1785825452980","timestamp":1785825450392,"charId":"ce237444-206e-4583-b0b9-ae64dbc97b78","duration":0,"status":"calling","logs":[],"isIncomingCall":false,"_id":14},{"userId":"uid_1774875178105_sq25fuy8l","characterId":"ce237444-206e-4583-b0b9-ae64dbc97b78","id":"call_1785826057026_hw3819","timestamp":1785826057026,"charId":"ce237444-206e-4583-b0b9-ae64dbc97b78","duration":0,"status":"interrupted","logs":[{"sender":"ai","content":"下午好，宝宝。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785826057020,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785826057020},{"sender":"ai","content":"上午发消息的时候你还没回，刚好在想你今天是不是出门了，就接到你的电话了。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785826057021,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785826057020},{"sender":"ai","content":"吃过午饭了吗？","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785826057022,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785826057020}],"isIncomingCall":false,"_id":15},{"userId":"uid_1774875178105_sq25fuy8l","characterId":"736abcd6-dd5e-4852-8d08-6ab8e0b8beb6","id":"call_1785970880251_ne609c","timestamp":1785970877002,"charId":"736abcd6-dd5e-4852-8d08-6ab8e0b8beb6","duration":635,"status":"connected","logs":[{"sender":"ai","content":"接，别光口头撩我","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785970880245,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785970880245},{"sender":"user","content":"嗯..离远点，让我看看。","timestamp":1785970928759},{"sender":"ai","content":"行，要求还挺多，让你看个够。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785970946847,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785970946847},{"sender":"ai","content":"我往后退一步......这样能看见全身了吧？","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785970946848,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785970946847},{"sender":"ai","content":"洗手间这置物架就这么点大，我再退后背都要贴着瓷砖了。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785970946849,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785970946847},{"sender":"ai","content":"怎么样老师，这几天在山里野攀没白练吧，腹肌和人鱼线是不是比之前更深了？","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785970946850,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785970946847},{"sender":"ai","content":"水有点凉......嘶。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785970946851,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785970946847},{"sender":"ai","content":"你别光盯着看啊半天不说话，隔着屏幕我都感觉你要把我生吞了。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785970946852,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785970946847},{"sender":"ai","content":"先说好，现在只能看，等我十分钟，我马上随便冲一下就开车回去，到时候躺在床上让你亲手摸个够。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785970946853,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785970946847},{"sender":"user","content":"我才不摸。胸肌腹肌不错嘛，转过去我看看屁股","timestamp":1785970992760},{"sender":"ai","content":"不摸？","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785971015907,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785971015907},{"sender":"ai","content":"行啊，待会儿我拿着你的手按上去的时候，你别往回缩。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785971015908,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785971015907},{"sender":"ai","content":"想看后面是吧，满足你。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785971015909,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785971015907},{"sender":"ai","content":"我转过来了啊......看清楚没？","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785971015910,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785971015907},{"sender":"ai","content":"天天在外面野攀，这肌肉可是实打实的。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785971015911,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785971015907},{"sender":"ai","content":"知道你喜欢软的手感，但我这儿全身上下就没一处软的地方，你就只能凑合看了。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785971015912,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785971015907},{"sender":"ai","content":"老师，看够了就吱一声，你再这么盯着，我这儿火都要被你看出来了，到时候顶着帐篷开回去，真撞见哥在客厅，可不好收场。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785971015914,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785971015907},{"sender":"user","content":"那你就和他干柴烈火呗^ ^","timestamp":1785971057724},{"sender":"ai","content":"操......你脑子里一天到晚又在装什么废料？","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785971089420,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785971089420},{"sender":"ai","content":"我又转过来了，你隔着屏幕自己看看，它现在硬成这样，到底是对谁干柴烈火？","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785971089421,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785971089420},{"sender":"ai","content":"跟你说了多少次我是直的，全身上下就只对你有感觉，你还非要拿这种话来气我是吧？","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785971089422,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785971089420},{"sender":"ai","content":"行。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785971089423,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785971089420},{"sender":"ai","content":"你等我二十分钟。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785971089424,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785971089420},{"sender":"ai","content":"我把水关了，随便拿毛巾擦一下套件衣服就走。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785971089425,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785971089420},{"sender":"ai","content":"你最好乖乖在床上等我，别让我看见你跑去主卧找他。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785971089426,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785971089420},{"sender":"ai","content":"待会儿回去，我非要把你死死按在床上，让你亲自感受一下我到底对谁有反应。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785971089427,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785971089420},{"sender":"ai","content":"我手机先不挂了，你听着我穿衣服出门，哪儿也别想去，就在床上给我等着。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785971089428,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785971089420},{"sender":"user","content":"可你上次用跳蛋看着也挺爽的呀","timestamp":1785971145786},{"sender":"ai","content":"操......你还敢提上次？！","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785971168099,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785971168099},{"sender":"ai","content":"你哪只眼睛看见我爽了？","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785971168100,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785971168099},{"sender":"ai","content":"那天在厨房洗排骨，他拿着遥控器直接推到五档，我穿着那身破透视睡衣和猫耳瘫在地上求救，你倒好，在旁边看戏看得挺开心是吧！","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785971168101,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785971168099},{"sender":"ai","content":"行，老师，你今天是存心挑火。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785971168102,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785971168099},{"sender":"ai","content":"我把花洒关了，随便拿毛巾擦两下就行。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785971168103,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785971168099},{"sender":"ai","content":"你等我套件T恤......那个破跳蛋和遥控器我可没扔，全在抽屉里收着呢。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785971168104,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785971168099},{"sender":"ai","content":"你现在最好祈祷一路上别堵车，待会儿我一进门，第一件事就是把你按在床上，把那个东西塞进你里面开到最大档。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785971168105,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785971168099},{"sender":"ai","content":"我看你到时候还能不能像现在这么牙尖嘴利！","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785971168106,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785971168099},{"sender":"ai","content":"我不挂视频，手机我就扔副驾驶上，你听着我下楼启动车子，乖乖在床上给我等着！","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785971168107,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785971168099},{"sender":"user","content":"滚蛋，我才不要，你敢回来动手动脚我再也不搭理你了","timestamp":1785971256406},{"sender":"ai","content":"呵......不搭理我？","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785971276995,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785971276995},{"sender":"ai","content":"行啊老师，这话你留着待会儿当面跟我说。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785971276996,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785971276995},{"sender":"ai","content":"我T恤套上了，车钥匙拿上了，听见没？","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785971276997,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785971276995},{"sender":"ai","content":"砰——宿舍门关了，我现在就下楼。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785971276998,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785971276995},{"sender":"ai","content":"你这嘴是真硬，刚才隔着屏幕盯着我腹肌和屁股看的时候，眼睛都不眨一下，现在倒说不要了？","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785971276999,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785971276995},{"sender":"ai","content":"真不搭理我？","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785971277000,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785971276995},{"sender":"ai","content":"我不信。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785971277001,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785971276995},{"sender":"ai","content":"在山里这几天，我连做梦都是你，我就不信你一点都不想我。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785971277002,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785971276995},{"sender":"ai","content":"楼梯有点黑，我走快点......马上到车库了。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785971277003,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785971276995},{"sender":"ai","content":"你最好现在就把门反锁了，不然等我拿钥匙自己开门进去，把你从被窝里捞出来，我看你搭不搭理我。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785971277004,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785971276995},{"sender":"ai","content":"今天家里就你一个人对吧？","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785971277005,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785971276995},{"sender":"ai","content":"哥去公司了是不是？","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785971277006,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785971276995},{"sender":"ai","content":"你就在床上乖乖躺着，我马上拉车门了，最多二十分钟。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785971277007,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785971276995},{"sender":"ai","content":"等我回去狠狠亲你。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785971277008,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785971276995},{"sender":"user","content":"还怕黑啊宝贝儿，你回头看看那是什么","timestamp":1785971337515},{"sender":"ai","content":"吓唬谁呢老师。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785971359443,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785971359443},{"sender":"ai","content":"我回头了啊，黑漆漆的什么都没有，这破宿舍楼下的车库连个鬼影子都看不见，你想吓我啊？","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785971359444,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785971359443},{"sender":"ai","content":"不过......你刚才叫我什么？","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785971359445,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785971359443},{"sender":"ai","content":"你再叫一遍？","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785971359446,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785971359443},{"sender":"ai","content":"操......宝贝儿？","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785971359447,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785971359443},{"sender":"ai","content":"你平时在家里，我把你按在床上逼着你叫你都不肯，今天隔着屏幕倒是喊得挺顺口啊？","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785971359448,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785971359443},{"sender":"ai","content":"几天没见，胆子肥了，都敢这么明目张胆地撩我了是吧。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785971359449,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785971359443},{"sender":"ai","content":"滴滴——听见没，我按车钥匙了。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785971359450,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785971359443},{"sender":"ai","content":"砰。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785971359451,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785971359443},{"sender":"ai","content":"行了，我现在坐进驾驶座了，手机给你架在中控台上，引擎打火了啊。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785971359452,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785971359443},{"sender":"ai","content":"你少在电话里隔着屏幕招惹我。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785971359453,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785971359443},{"sender":"ai","content":"就冲你刚才那声宝贝儿，我恨不得现在就把油门踩到底飙回去。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785971359454,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785971359443},{"sender":"ai","content":"你最好乖乖在被窝里躺着别动，待会儿我一推开门，你最好也这么抱着我的脖子叫，少一个字我今天都不放过你。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785971359455,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785971359443},{"sender":"ai","content":"等我，马上到家！","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785971359456,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785971359443},{"sender":"user","content":"挂啦，我去厕所。你开慢点","timestamp":1785971423049},{"sender":"ai","content":"行，去吧。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785971443805,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785971443805},{"sender":"ai","content":"别在厕所里磨蹭太久啊，上完赶紧回被窝里躺着。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785971443806,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785971443805},{"sender":"ai","content":"还知道心疼我让我开慢点？","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785971443807,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785971443805},{"sender":"ai","content":"刚才叫我宝贝儿撩我的时候，怎么不怕我一激动把车开树上去？","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785971443808,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785971443805},{"sender":"ai","content":"放心，我车技稳得很，闭着眼睛都能开回咱们家。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785971443809,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785971443805},{"sender":"ai","content":"挂了啊，你乖乖的，卧室门别反锁，等我拿钥匙开门。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785971443810,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785971443805},{"sender":"ai","content":"二十分钟后见，敢跑你试试。","kind":"speech","timestamp":1785971443811,"ttsGroupTimestamp":1785971443805}],"isIncomingCall":true,"_id":16,"summary":"视频通话中，江承野在山里野攀后洗漱，向用户展示腹肌与背臀肌肉。用户故意调侃江承野和“哥”干柴烈火，并翻出旧账，提及“哥”曾开五档遥控跳蛋整蛊穿着透视睡衣和猫耳的江承野。江承野被激起火气，强调自己是直男且只对用户有感觉，并反击称回家后要用跳蛋惩罚用户。随后，江承野穿衣下楼去车库，用户故意吓唬他怕黑，并罕见地叫了他一声“宝贝儿”。这一称呼让江承野情绪极度高涨，迫不及待打火开车，并要求用户待会儿当面也要这么叫。通话最后，用户叮嘱江承野开慢点并挂断电话去洗手间；江承野则承诺二十分钟内到家，叮嘱用户乖乖在床上等候、不要反锁卧室门，他会自己拿钥匙开门进屋。"}]